.venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.DS_Store

# generated data and checkpoints — regenerate with producer.py
data/*.jsonl
data/*.json
data/raw/
spark-warehouse/
checkpoint/
metastore_db/
derby.log

# jars pulled by spark-submit --packages
jars/

# keep results and figures — they are the deliverable
!results/**/*.csv

# Local planning files
project_plan.md

# The spec is the assignment brief, not a deliverable of this repo.
# docs/ is NOT ignored: the report, the figures and docs/DECISIONS.md all live
# there and are listed as deliverables in SPEC section 12. Ignoring the whole
# directory meant anything written there went missing from every commit, and
# the !docs/figures/*.png negation above it could never take effect, because
# git does not descend into an excluded directory to re-include a file.
SPEC.md
scratch.py

clickhouse_data/
*.log
